<title>USA: American Oilfield Divers relocates.</title>
<headline>American Oilfield Divers relocates.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Oilfield Divers Inc said Tuesday its corporate headquarters has relocated to Houston from Lafayette, La.</p>
<p>American Oilfield Divers, founded in 1981 by chairman George Yax, provides subsea services, including diving, to the offshore oil and gas industry.</p>
<p>&quot;The move of our corporate headquarters ... allows us to offer a broader base of support for our growing Gulf Services operations,&quot; chief executive Rod Stanley said.</p>
<p>&quot;We will continue our Gulf Services operations at the Port of Iberia, La., and maintain a sales and administrative office in Lafayette for our expanding Gulf of Mexico client base.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
